              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kapaarasia nuka Sau! kitijioto Ikagarin, luaario kakaninikec: kiboioto kowemanakec anatar akwap kere kari nakokide naka Gilead.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.5.10",
