        {
          "text": "Odwe luka Reuben, ka Igadin, ka atutubet naka ateker naka Manase, ituŋa luetitin, iruna luepedorete aidak ebuku ka ekileŋ, ka aigum kakabwa, luepiriaka ejie, emwaasi ilukumin akaisaoŋon ka luonon, ka akwat akanykaarei ka akaisakanykape, luepedorete alosit oiie, ",
