              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lu kesi ikapolok luka ikekia luka lukapapaakee; Eper, ka Isi, ka Eliel, ka Asuriel, ka Yeremia, ka Kodabia, ka Yadiel, ituŋa lukirigin luetitin, lukodwaratau, ikapolok luka ikekia luka lukapapaakec. ",
          "type": "text",
