              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisidik Edeke loka Isirael emoyo loka Pul ekabaka loka Asuria, ka emoyo loka Tiligat-pilineser ekabaka loka Asuria, kijoreo kes, Ireubin ka Igadin, ka atutubet naka ateker naka Manase, koyau kes Kala, ka Kabor, ka Kara, kiton ocor loka Gosan, kiton lolo.",
